## Common Pitfalls to Avoid

1. **❌ Querying without tenant_id** - Always filter by tenant
2. **❌ Mixing constants and types** - Keep them separate
3. **❌ Hardcoding values** - Use constants or env variables
4. **❌ Skipping validation** - Always validate with Zod
5. **❌ Missing error handling** - Handle all error cases
6. **❌ Not logging audit trail** - Log all important actions
7. **❌ Client components without 'use client'** - Add directive when using hooks
8. **❌ Using HTML entities in JSX** - Use `{"text's here"}` instead

